  "body": "Completes the deep functional rebuild scope (organ features, both demos) \u2014 the spreadsheet landed in #12/#13; this is the React Reference AppAI. All four Gen-4 organ behaviors are implemented *functionally* (not just described) and **browser-verified** via the preview harness: Babel compiles the full inline TSX, React mounts, zero runtime console errors (only the benign \">500KB\" Babel deopt note).\n\n- **Graded memory** \u2014 `Cube.deweight()` + a weight overlay in `read()` (drop DEWEIGHT bookkeeping, hide ghosts, order by weight; a **no-op** for bands with no deweight activity). Body primitives `memory.deweight` / `memory.ghosts`. `append()` assigns band-unique ids. *Verified: old value hidden from the live stream, recoverable via a ghost read, target entry never mutated.*\n- **Self / Other** \u2014 the genesis key (`mintGenesisKey` + FNV keyed MAC) minted into the **Body** (`state.genesisKey` via `initS`), never in a cube band, never in the MIND's prompt. Body primitives `self.sign` / `self.is_self` / `self.fingerprint`. *Verified: unique key per body, SELF verifies, forged + cloned MACs are OTHER (anti-clone), key absent from cube reads.*\n- **Schedule pulse** \u2014 `heart.schedule` / `heart.cancel` / `heart.fireDue` on `state.scheduledPulses`. *Verified: a pulse fires on its due beat and not before (one-shot).*\n- **Nociception** \u2014 `heart.pain`, the NOW interrupt companion to `heart.schedule`'s *later*; returns a distress wake `{reason, band, ref, scheduled:false}`.\n\nNotes: helpers are **hoisted function declarations at outer (non-VCW) scope** (the inner-scope trap that broke `bootMantleAgent` in the spreadsheet was caught here too); the self-fingerprint helper is `selfKeyFp` to avoid colliding with the pre-existing API-key `keyFingerprint`. `ORGAN_ATLAS` Heart/Genome/Immune/Memory updated. The Stage-1 self-audit needs a *born* (awakened) agent; on a bare pre-birth fixture it blocks on birth-infra checks (Primer present, canonical bands, surface parity) \u2014 none of which my additive changes touch.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
